[en.FOCUS_C11_THESTRAL_EMPIRE]
Nightmare Returns

[en.FOCUS_C11_THESTRAL_EMPIRE_desc]
We have successfully captured Tartarus. However, no matter whether we continue to advance eastward or stay to manage Tartarus, we seem to have encountered some difficulties — just as the Equestria Empire once encountered: various strange creatures such as Thestrals and Bugbears seem to be unwilling to submit to the control of the Changelings.\nWell, if they are only unwilling, the armed forces of the Changelings have ways to make them willing. But what is more difficult is that these barbaric creatures seem to be unable to understand our requirements.\nAmong all the creatures near Tartarus, only Thestrals have the highest sociality and organization. Therefore, we need the support of Thestrals to control this area. It is known that Thestrals unconditionally obey the Nightmare Moon — and at this moment, if nothing unexpected happens, Princess Luna should be imprisoned in the Tartarus prison. So...

[zh.FOCUS_C11_THESTRAL_EMPIRE]
梦魇再临

[zh.FOCUS_C11_THESTRAL_EMPIRE_desc]
我们已经成功夺取了塔尔塔洛斯，但无论是继续东进，还是管理塔尔塔洛斯，似乎都遇到了不小的困难——正如小马利亚帝国曾经所遇到的麻烦一样，夜骐、蜂熊等各种稀奇古怪的生物似乎并不是很愿意服从幻形灵的管制。\n如果他们仅仅是不配合的话，幻形灵的武装力量有的是办法让他们配合，但更加难办的是，那些野蛮的生物似乎不能理解我们的要求。\n在塔尔塔洛斯附近所有的生物中，只有夜骐具有最高的社会性和组织性。因此，我们需要获得夜骐的支持来管理这片地区。据了解，夜骐无条件的服从于梦魇之月——而此时此刻，不出意外的话，露娜公主应该正关押在塔尔塔洛斯监狱中。所以说...

